<p class="description">
Upload a CSV file with event data. The first row must contain column headers.</p>
<form method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data">
<input type="hidden" name="_wpnonce" value="nonce-nettertech_events_csv_import" /> <input type="hidden" name="nettertech_events_csv_step" value="map" />
<table class="form-table">
<tr>
<th scope="row">
<label for="nettertech_events_csv_file">CSV File</label>
</th>
<td>
<input type="file" id="nettertech_events_csv_file" name="nettertech_events_csv_file"
accept=".csv,.tsv,.txt" required />
<p class="description">
Accepted formats: .csv, .tsv, .txt. Maximum size: 2MB. </p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p class="submit"><input type="submit" name="submit" value="Upload and Continue" class="button button-primary" /></p></form>